---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

import {
  site
} from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Nadim Abdel Meguid | Soleil & Stone"
  description="Background, perspective and current focus of Nadim Abdel Meguid, founder of Soleil & Stone."
>

  <!-- =====================================================
       HERO
       ===================================================== -->

  <section
    class="
      max-w-6xl
      w-full
      mx-auto
      px-6
      py-20
    "
  >

    <div
      class="
        grid
        lg:grid-cols-12
        gap-12
        items-center
      "
    >

      <div
        class="
          lg:col-span-8
        "
      >

        <span
          class="
            inline-block
            text-[10px]
            uppercase
            tracking-[0.2em]
            text-brand-gold
            font-semibold
            mb-5
          "
        >
          About
        </span>


        <h1
          class="
            font-serif
            text-4xl
            sm:text-5xl
            text-brand-charcoal
            leading-[1.15]
            mb-7
          "
        >
          Technical Roots.
          Global Perspective.
          Ecosystem Focus.
        </h1>


        <p
          class="
            text-base
            sm:text-lg
            text-brand-slate
            leading-relaxed
            font-light
            max-w-3xl
          "
        >
          I’m an Industrial Engineer working at the intersection
          of hardware commercialization, industry fieldwork,
          and innovation ecosystems—connecting technical product
          development, manufacturing resources, market intelligence,
          and regional networks.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div
        class="
          lg:col-span-4
        "
      >

        <img
          src={site.profileImage}
          alt="Nadim Abdel Meguid"
          class="
            w-full
            max-w-sm
            mx-auto
            border
            border-brand-border
          "
        />

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>



  <!-- =====================================================
       BACKGROUND
       ===================================================== -->

  <section
    class="
      bg-brand-cream
      border-y
      border-brand-border
    "
  >

    <div
      class="
        max-w-6xl
        w-full
        mx-auto
        px-6
        py-16
      "
    >

      <div
        class="
          grid
          md:grid-cols-3
          gap-10
        "
      >

        <!-- ENGINEERING -->

        <div>

          <span
            class="
              text-[10px]
              uppercase
              tracking-[0.18em]
              text-brand-gold
              font-semibold
            "
          >
            Background
          </span>


          <h2
            class="
              font-serif
              text-2xl
              text-brand-charcoal
              mt-2
              mb-4
            "
          >
            Engineering First
          </h2>


          <p
            class="
              text-sm
              text-brand-slate
              font-light
              leading-relaxed
            "
          >
            I trained as an Industrial Engineer in France
            and built my career around technically complex
            products, product integration, customer needs,
            and the path from engineering decisions to
            commercial adoption.
          </p>

        </div>



        <!-- ECOSYSTEMS -->

        <div>

          <span
            class="
              text-[10px]
              uppercase
              tracking-[0.18em]
              text-brand-gold
              font-semibold
            "
          >
            Perspective
          </span>


          <h2
            class="
              font-serif
              text-2xl
              text-brand-charcoal
              mt-2
              mb-4
            "
          >
            Across Ecosystems
          </h2>


          <p
            class="
              text-sm
              text-brand-slate
              font-light
              leading-relaxed
            "
          >
            Raised in Cairo, educated in France, shaped
            professionally by the Bay Area, and now based
            in San Diego, I’ve experienced how different
            technical and entrepreneurial ecosystems
            create—and sometimes constrain—opportunity.
          </p>

        </div>



        <!-- CURRENT FOCUS -->

        <div>

          <span
            class="
              text-[10px]
              uppercase
              tracking-[0.18em]
              text-brand-gold
              font-semibold
            "
          >
            Current Focus
          </span>


          <h2
            class="
              font-serif
              text-2xl
              text-brand-charcoal
              mt-2
              mb-4
            "
          >
            Connecting The Pieces
          </h2>


          <p
            class="
              text-sm
              text-brand-slate
              font-light
              leading-relaxed
            "
          >
            My current work focuses on connecting technical
            product development, manufacturing resources,
            market intelligence, and founder networks to help
            hardware technologies move toward real-world adoption.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>



  <!-- =====================================================
       SOLEIL & STONE
       ===================================================== -->

  <section
    class="
      max-w-4xl
      w-full
      mx-auto
      px-6
      py-20
    "
  >

    <span
      class="
        text-[10px]
        uppercase
        tracking-[0.2em]
        text-brand-gold
        font-semibold
      "
    >
      Soleil & Stone
    </span>


    <h2
      class="
        font-serif
        text-3xl
        sm:text-4xl
        text-brand-charcoal
        mt-2
        mb-7
      "
    >
      A Home For The Work
    </h2>


    <div
      class="
        space-y-6
        text-base
        text-brand-slate
        leading-relaxed
        font-light
      "
    >

      <p>
        Soleil & Stone is a personal platform for the
        communities, field observations, and projects I’m
        building around hardware commercialization,
        industry engagement, and innovation ecosystems.
      </p>


      <p>
        The name reflects the places that shaped me:
        “Soleil” connects to France and the California
        coast, while “Stone” carries a connection to
        Egypt, permanence, and the idea that meaningful
        things are built on strong foundations.
      </p>


      <p>
        The goal is to document what I’m learning from the
        field, bring thoughtful people together, and create
        useful connections between technical ideas, people,
        manufacturing resources, and execution.
      </p>

    </div>



    <!-- =================================================
         LINKS
         ================================================= -->

    <div
      class="
        flex
        flex-wrap
        gap-x-7
        gap-y-3
        mt-10
      "
    >

      <a
        href="/community/"
        class="
          inline-flex
          items-center
          gap-2
          text-[11px]
          uppercase
          tracking-[0.16em]
          font-semibold
          text-brand-charcoal
          hover:text-brand-gold
          transition-colors
        "
      >
        Community

        <span>
          →
        </span>
      </a>


      <a
        href="/field-notes/"
        class="
          inline-flex
          items-center
          gap-2
          text-[11px]
          uppercase
          tracking-[0.16em]
          font-semibold
          text-brand-charcoal
          hover:text-brand-gold
          transition-colors
        "
      >
        Field Notes

        <span>
          →
        </span>
      </a>


      <a
        href="/fieldwork/"
        class="
          inline-flex
          items-center
          gap-2
          text-[11px]
          uppercase
          tracking-[0.16em]
          font-semibold
          text-brand-charcoal
          hover:text-brand-gold
          transition-colors
        "
      >
        Industry Fieldwork

        <span>
          →
        </span>
      </a>

    </div>

  </section>

</BaseLayout>
